          "type": {
            "kind": "u64"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "usernameUpdatedAt",
          "type": {
            "kind": "u64"
          },
          "doc": "Dedicated LWW clock for username/avatar edits. Merging on `joined_at`\n(which never changes after the first join) would freeze a member's\nusername at its first value across nodes; this field is the real\nlast-writer-wins timestamp for profile edits."
        }
      ]
    },
